      <item>
        <title>It&apos;s funny because I always feel like I&apos;m just saying the same things. But that&apos;s how persuasion works! Repetition! Also, always remember that someone will be encountering your thoughts for the first time every day.</title>
        <dc:creator>@dhh</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>It's funny because I always feel like I'm just saying the same things. But that's how persuasion works! Repetition! Also, always remember that someone will be encountering your thoughts for the first time every day.</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>David Senra (@davidsenra)</b>
<p>
<p>This mashup from my episode with <a href="https://nitter.net/dhh" title="DHH">@dhh</a> is awesome and hilarious and hopefully convinces you to watch the whole thing. It’s on pace to be the most popular episode so far:</p>
<a href="https://nitter.net/davidsenra/status/2083219339260649704#m">
