      <item>
        <title>I&apos;ve found it incredibly useful to have Opus 5 check the work of Sol or vice versa. Interesting to see the prompt that Sol here uses with Opus!</title>
        <dc:creator>@dhh</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>I've found it incredibly useful to have Opus 5 check the work of Sol or vice versa. Interesting to see the prompt that Sol here uses with Opus!</p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHObMJWSXsAASq7C.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
        <pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 21:18:47 GMT</pubDate>
