      <item>
        <title>Danish state just paid out millions of kroner in compensation to children under 18 who suffered severe injuries from the Covid vaccine. Danish doctor calls the whole campaign to vaccinate children &quot;a mistake&quot;. Remember when this discussion was verboten? https://www.dr.dk/nyheder/indland/det-var-ikke-det-vaerd-siger-boernelaege-efter-millionerstatning-i-sager-om-coronavacciner</title>
        <dc:creator>@dhh</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Danish state just paid out millions of kroner in compensation to children under 18 who suffered severe injuries from the Covid vaccine. Danish doctor calls the whole campaign to vaccinate children "a mistake". Remember when this discussion was verboten?  <a href="https://www.dr.dk/nyheder/indland/det-var-ikke-det-vaerd-siger-boernelaege-efter-millionerstatning-i-sager-om-coronavacciner">dr.dk/nyheder/indland/det-va…</a></p>
<hr/>
<b>Link</b><br>
<a href="https://www.dr.dk/nyheder/indland/det-var-ikke-det-vaerd-siger-boernelaege-efter-millionerstatning-i-sager-om-coronavacciner">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/card_img%2F2082518767448252416%2FwueKO2gK%3Fformat%3Djpg%26name%3D800x419" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>&apos;Det var ikke det værd&apos;, siger børnelæge efter millionerstatning i sager om coronavacciner</b>
</a>
<p>Børnelæge Klaus Birkelund Johansen mener ikke, det var det værd, mens professor i infektionsmedicin Jens Lundgren forsvarer beslutningen.</p>
<small><a href="https://www.dr.dk/nyheder/indland/det-var-ikke-det-vaerd-siger-boernelaege-efter-millionerstatning-i-sager-om-coronavacciner">dr.dk</a></small>]]></description>
